  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open enrolment",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Deploy App, open <strong>MDM</strong> and tap <strong>Open for 2 hours</strong>. Each opening makes a new challenge.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b5d4bd107bb4855f.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Give Fleet the challenge",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Run <code>odmdm-fleet challenge</code> and paste the new challenge. Phones asking with an old one are turned away.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9a778930f0becaf7.webp",
              "width": 1400,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See who is waiting",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><code>odmdm-fleet phones</code> lists the team. Check that the phones waiting are the ones in your hands.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9b2accf151b02deb.webp",
              "width": 1400,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Name them all at once",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><code>odmdm-fleet name --all OTTER</code> gives every waiting phone the next free number.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1aef989a4506941d.webp",
              "width": 1400,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Or choose each name",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Give the number from the list and the callsign you want. Any phones, in any order.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/48eaf76884392fe4.webp",
              "width": 1400,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Callsign rules",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Use 3–32 letters, digits or hyphens, with no hyphen at either end. A revoked callsign cannot be used again.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/aef47a49db9deec4.webp",
              "width": 1400,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Wait for the phones",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Within 20 minutes each phone appears here under its callsign. When all are in, tap <strong>Close now</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f696b94f6eeafb1a.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
